cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the results in this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Predicting HbA1c trajectory in type 2 diabetes (Jordan EHR)"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and aggregate results for a three-class model of the direction of a patient's
  next HbA1c measurement, derived from routinely collected electronic health record data of a
  Jordanian health system. A gradient-boosted tree, a BEHRT-style transformer and a
  regression-to-the-mean logistic baseline are compared on one temporal, patient-disjoint split,
  with an information-matched factorial analysis of numeric input representation.
type: software
